---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="review-invitation"><div class="container review-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">OPINIONES EN GOOGLE</p><h2>Conoce otras experiencias.</h2><p>Lee las reseñas de la clínica directamente en Google.</p></div><a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=Cl%C3%ADnica+Dos+de+Mayo+Pod%C3%B3logo+M%C3%B3stoles&hl=es" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>4,6<span>/5</span></strong><small>134 reseñas en Google <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></small></a></div></section>
<style>.review-invitation{padding:65px 0;background:var(--sand)}.review-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px}.review-inner h2{font-size:34px;margin:15px 0}.review-inner p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.review-inner>a{color:var(--green)}.review-inner strong{font-family:'DM Serif Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:63px;letter-spacing:-2px;display:block}.review-inner strong span{font-size:28px}.review-inner small{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:800px){.review-inner{display:block}.review-inner>a{display:block;margin-top:25px}.review-inner h2{font-size:30px}}
</style>
